{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10414","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茫茫浊河注，怀古临河滨。\n禹功本豁达，汉迹方因循。\n坎德昔滂沱，冯夷胡不仁。\n激潏陵堤防，东郡多悲辛。\n天子忽惊悼，从官皆负薪。\n畚筑岂无谋，祈祷如有神。\n宣房今安在，高岸空嶙峋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}